  "description": "The URS ONE is here for the kinds of gravel adventures you plan… as well as the ones you most definitely didn’t. BMC Advanced Carbon layup? Sure. Low-maintenance? As much as possible. Capable of rough riding? Absolutely. A bad-decision enabler? Often.\nIts frame and fork are loaded with real utility: spacious downtube storage for big days out and all eventualities, multiple cargo mounts that make it a great bikepacking bike, a compliant D-shape seatpost that whispers “relax, it’s fine” across rough ground, and reinforced protectors that keep the carbon safe because you’re likely to churn up some debris.\nWe set it all up with an ultra-versatile SRAM Rival and GX Eagle AXS drivetrain for gearing and braking that handles anything, anywhere – plus the tough, adventure-ready BMC AG 20 gravel wheelset so you never have to tiptoe your way through anything.\nRider-friendly by design and fully equipped for deliberate or accidental adventures, your URS One is ready for whatever your map (or your curiosity) throws at it.",
